{"id":2871,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><div><div><p>为深化学生会团队凝聚力，筑牢成员间的信任纽带，4月10日下午，中北大学体育学院学生会“信任背摔——以心相交，以行托底”团体心理活动，在中北大学羽毛球馆东侧顺利开展。本次活动由学院学生科王卫兵老师主持，团委学生会骨干参加。</p><p>活动以信任背摔为核心项目，成员们分组轮流完成“高台背摔”与“地面守护”任务。高台上，挑战者后仰倒下，是对团队毫无保留的交付；地面上，队员们手扣手、肩并肩稳稳承接，是对责任最生动的践行。从忐忑试探到从容坚定，从紧张磨合到默契无间，现场加油声、欢呼声不断。大家在一次次“交付与守护”中，深刻体会到信任是双向的责任与担当，尽显体育学子的青春风貌。</p><p>活动尾声，王老师围绕“信任、责任、协作、担当”作总结讲话。他强调，学生会是服务同学的核心枢纽，唯有以信任为纽带、以协作为桥梁，才能打造有温度、有战斗力的学生组织，鼓励大家将感悟融入日常，践行学生会的初心使命。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=RLRA7VU4v8oRfkLVmGaollaM8VVnzN2PMRAfnl-4UmGaUmC0gihFp2hmCIa0L1yiMkhfoSy8U4CDL8V2n7LiLR6VMmAVoRl4MRVVMlL8n7nFn7-sLzNZLmAFMmrfozlJqjfjo4Oeosnb_dN0qIbtpYyPLRUig47DLmvsgtA8pUdcc&oid=1054562613&tid=1045&nid=16277&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/254A94C663AFDC507E68E85341E5C4DD/DB719828/65A95\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=Rn7U7aMmLYolM2oVl7iLmviMz9DLlQ27LRGZU4r2M4vDM4C0gihFp2hmCIa0MYyDMYy8USyYUz7PLmCaLRUYLznfnNlZL4QRMzGsL7WVU4AFn7liLmWfnzQFUlUaM8VRgtXaQ4Oeo4x8_5AbgDTJQty0LzG8MSyPMm-sMYbw62d8c&oid=1054562613&tid=1045&nid=16277&e=.jpg\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=RMRT77o7n2M4nknV7rfU4vaL49bM4N28oRLYolW2MmT7o7l0gihFp2hmCIa0LSh7MShVLYy8nNCbn7Q7L8n2MmvbnmQ2MRVVnm-DM49YUlQFU4-iozliMzMFo7LsU4vJqjfjo4Oeosnb_dN0qIbtpYyPLRUig47DLmvsgtA8pUdcc&oid=1054562613&tid=1045&nid=16277&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/1D5E34FF9DFD3DF679F6F41EF26782AF/C2595553/8C7C7\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=RUzN7PMR6fMlrknVmC8L7UZL4r2ozV2RMNUYLlUiM4nkL7-0gihFp2hmCIa0Mkh2n1yaoSyiUmrRn7LZMm-4LRM2nm9PMzl4olWfUznkLNMFLNliU4f2MRfFnR9Znmv4gtXaQ4Oeo4x8_5AbgDTJQty0LzG8MSyPMm-sMYbw62d8c&oid=1054562613&tid=1045&nid=16277&e=.jpg\"></p></div></div></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://tyxy.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=RLRA7VU4v8oRfkLVmGaollaM8VVnzN2PMRAfnl-4UmGaUmC0gihFp2hmCIa0L1yiMkhfoSy8U4CDL8V2n7LiLR6VMmAVoRl4MRVVMlL8n7nFn7-sLzNZLmAFMmrfozlJqjfjo4Oeosnb_dN0qIbtpYyPLRUig47DLmvsgtA8pU